---
title: "Load the capture module before dispatching its effect"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: in progress
    lg1: Breaks NoDeadlock or ReadyHasHandler
    lg2: Path to the NoDeadlock or ReadyHasHandler bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 breaks
  class lg2 bugPath
  s0: Module loading
  s1: Capture handler missing
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: module loads without registering capture
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 breaks
  class s1 bugPath
